Condite contains components under different licenses. This overview does not
relicense any component or third-party material.

- condite-core and condite-ctl: AGPL-3.0-or-later; see each crate's LICENSE.
- condite-shared, condite-sdk, condite-sdk-node, condite-sdk-wasm and
  condite-metadata: MIT; see each crate's LICENSE.
- Vencord integrations: GPL-3.0-or-later; see clients/vencord/COPYING and
  clients/vencord-extension/COPYING.
- Shared client translations: MIT; see clients/i18n/LICENSE.

Other files retain their existing copyright and license notices. A directory
without an explicit license is not granted a new license by this overview.
Bundled agent skills retain their upstream licenses and notices.
